    pc "Ok, beh, allora ti accompagno a casa."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:227
translate italian kendra10_e55654eb:

    # "I half expect her to decline, as she always has, but she surprises me."
    "Mi aspetto quasi che rifiuti, come ha sempre fatto, ma mi sorprende."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:228
translate italian kendra10_6b24b15d:

    # sg "Okay. Thank you."
    sg "Ok. Grazie."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:231
translate italian kendra10_7203a414:

    # "I get dressed and we walk quietly down the stairs to the car."
    "Mi vesto e scendiamo in silenzio le scale fino alla macchina."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:233
translate italian kendra10_02d8636b:

    # "After she tells me where she lives, she just goes quiet and looks out the window as I drive."
    "Dopo avermi detto dove abita, rimane in silenzio e guarda fuori dal finestrino mentre guido."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:234
translate italian kendra10_e8f38523:

    # pc "Are you okay? Is there something wrong?"
    pc "Stai bene? C’è qualcosa che non va?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:235
translate italian kendra10_f0538064:

    # sg "Just a lot of things going through my mind right now."
    sg "È solo che mi passano per la testa un sacco di cose in questo momento."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:236
translate italian kendra10_1f404956:

    # pc "I'm here if you want to talk about them."
    pc "Sono qui se vuoi parlarne."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:238
translate italian kendra10_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/kendra_thanks.wav'
    voice 'voices/kendra_thanks.wav'

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:239
translate italian kendra10_24145239:

    # sg "Thanks [pcname]. I'm okay though."
    sg "Grazie [pcname]. Sto bene, però."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:240
translate italian kendra10_ba0d2f73:

    # "She doesn't talk any more on the way to her house. Just looks out the window with a vaguely sad expression, like she has something heavy weighing her down."
    "Non parla più per tutto il tragitto fino a casa sua. Si limita a guardare fuori dal finestrino con un'espressione vagamente triste, come se avesse un peso che le opprime il cuore."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:241
translate italian kendra10_64a5b77c:

    # "Eventually, we get to her house and I pull into the driveway."
    "Alla fine arriviamo a casa sua e imbocco il vialetto."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:244
translate italian kendra10_c5df86b3:

    # sg "This is it. My house."
    sg "Eccoci. Casa mia."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:245
translate italian kendra10_e619e55e:

    # pc "It's beautiful."
    pc "È bellissima."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:247
translate italian kendra10_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/kendra_thanks.wav'
    voice 'voices/kendra_thanks.wav'

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:248
translate italian kendra10_2de23a41:

    # sg "Thanks. Yeah, my parents are pretty loaded."
    sg "Grazie. Sì, i miei genitori sono piuttosto ricchi."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:249
translate italian kendra10_d5a2f61d:

    # sg "Anyway. Thank you for the ride. And for the great night."
    sg "Comunque. Grazie per il passaggio. E per la splendida serata."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:250
translate italian kendra10_e012cd4c:

    # sg "Sorry if my mood kind of brought it down. I'm okay. I promise."
    sg "Scusa se il mio umore ha un po' rovinato l'atmosfera. Sto bene. Te lo prometto."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:251
translate italian kendra10_04c0b2ef:

    # pc "I'm here for you, Kendra. Whatever you're going through, I'd love to know. Maybe I could help."
    pc "Sono qui per te, Kendra. Qualunque cosa tu stia passando, mi piacerebbe saperlo. Forse potrei aiutarti."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:252
translate italian kendra10_017fd7bf:

    # sg "Yeah. Maybe."
    sg "Sì. Forse."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:253
translate italian kendra10_312db7ab:

    # sg "Not tonight though."
    sg "Non stasera, però."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:254
translate italian kendra10_232aaf0e:

    # sg "I'll see you soon, okay?"
    sg "Ci vediamo presto, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:255
translate italian kendra10_63023601:

    # pc "Okay."
    pc "Ok."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:258
translate italian kendra10_4d548548:

    # sg "Bye, [pcname]."
    sg "Ciao, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:259
translate italian kendra10_cefa35dc:

    # pc "Bye, Kendra. Hope you have a good night."
    pc "Ciao, Kendra. Spero che tu passi una bella serata."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:260
translate italian kendra10_320c6e88:

    # sg "I already have."
    sg "L'ho già passata."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:263
translate italian kendra10_8d2ab21f:

    # "We separate and she walks to the front door of her house and walks inside after pressing in a code on a keypad."
    "Ci separiamo e lei si avvicina alla porta d'ingresso di casa sua ed entra dopo aver digitato un codice sul tastierino."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:264
translate italian kendra10_948f08f2:

    # "I go back to my car and drive home."
    "Io torno alla mia auto e guido verso casa."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:265
translate italian kendra10_db055602:

    # "I hope she's really okay. It definitely seemed like there was something wrong that she didn't want to talk about."
    "Spero che stia davvero bene. Sembrava proprio che ci fosse qualcosa che non andava e di cui non voleva parlare."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:266
translate italian kendra10_86d2266a:

    # "Hopefully she will open up to me soon."
    "Spero che presto si apra con me."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra10.rpy:269
translate italian kendra10_daa83263:

    # "Back at home, I collapse into bed and quickly fall asleep."
    "Una volta a casa, crollo sul letto e mi addormento subito."

